        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John D. Rockefeller III, David Rockefeller, Abby Rockefeller, Nelson Rockefeller, Laurance Rockefeller, Winthrop Rockefeller\n- Organizations: Chase Manhattan Corporation, Japan Society\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- John D. Rockefeller III had siblings named Abby Rockefeller, Nelson Rockefeller, Laurance Rockefeller, Winthrop Rockefeller, and David Rockefeller.\n- David Rockefeller was born on June 12, 1915, and died on March 20, 2017.\n- David Rockefeller was an American banker who served as chairman and chief executive of Chase Manhattan Corporation.\n- Japan Society suspended all activities during World War II.\n- Japan Society expanded after World War II under the leadership of John D. Rockefeller III.",
